REAL

Product path: the seed (trusted first oodac binary), then gcc.

  Compiler loop
    oodac check, emit-c, run / ooda CLI

  Self-host floor
    Backend-C: emit C, link the C runtime (chs_rt), then gcc, via the seed

  File seals
    read_file, write_file, path_exists, file_size, fs_mkdir, fs_remove_file
    Tokens: FsReadCap, FsWriteCap (old FsCap still accepted)

  Net seals
    fetch uses HttpCap
    TCP / UDP / bind slot IO uses TcpCap, UdpCap, BindCap
    ooda-pm (package manager) uses NetCap and FsWriteCap (sandbox)

  Process exec
    sys_exec and process_exec use ProcessCap (or SysCap)

  Process args and walk
    process_args(ProcessCap) in ../ooda/std/os/process.oo
    fs_walk(FsReadCap) in ../ooda/std/os/fs.oo

  Env, time, rand, alloc
    EnvCap (OODA_ and OO_ keys)
    TimeCap, RandCap, AllocCap

  Threads
    mutex, spawn, join, channels — ThreadCap

  Super SWARM Waves A-F (Shipped 2026-08-14)
    Wave A: Type-State Proofs & Refinement Solver
      std/src/ooda/typestate/ (typestate_types, typestate_transition, typestate_verify, typestate)
      std/src/ooda/proofs/ (refinement_types, refinement_solve, refinement)
      Compile-time affine token consumption, lifecycle transitions (Unopened -> Opened -> Closed).
    Wave B: Native LLVM IR Backend Emitter
      oodac/llvm_emit_*.oo (llvm_emit, preamble, fn, expr, stmt, call, arc, control, mem, binop, ty)
      Native LLVM IR generation with GEP offset computation, control flow phi-nodes, and ARC emission.
    Wave C: GPU / NPU Accelerated SIMD Compute Pipeline
      std/src/ooda/gpu/ (gpu_types, gpu_kernel, gpu_pipeline, gpu_dispatch, gpu)
      std/src/ooda/npu/ (npu_types, npu_tensor, npu_ops, npu)
      Accelerated SIMD vector pipelines gated by &GpuCap and &NpuCap capability tokens.
    Wave D: Contract Fuzzing & Ghost-State Pre/Post Verification
      std/src/ooda/fuzz/ (fuzz_types, fuzz_generator, fuzz_mutator, fuzz_engine, fuzz)
      std/src/ooda/proofs/ (ghost_state_types, ghost_state_ops, ghost_state)
      Automated contract-driven boundary fuzzing and pre/post condition ghost-state snapshotting.
    Wave E: Native Language Server Protocol (LSP) Engine
      std/src/ooda/lsp/ (7 modules) and ooda/lsp/ (7 modules)
      JSON-RPC 2.0 framing, diagnostic publication, auto-complete suggestions, hover docs.
    Wave F: Package Manager Dependency Resolver & Capability Mint Authority
      ooda/pm/ (manifest_types, manifest_parse, resolve_tree, archive_unpack, pm_engine, manifest, resolve)
      std/src/ooda/sec/mint/ (mint_types, mint_authority, mint_token, mint_verify, mint)
      SemVer Caret/Tilde constraint solving, zero-trust token provenance, and monotonic attenuation.

  Super SWARM Packages 1-4 (Shipped 2026-08-14)
    Package 1: Agent Tools & Developer AI Surface
      std/src/ooda/reflect/ (reflect_types, reflect_outline, reflect_doc, reflect)
      std/src/ooda/fix/ (fix_types, fix_engine, fix)
      std/src/ooda/fuzz/ (fuzz_net)
      Signature outliner (token-efficient agent reads), DINNER reflection, one-turn multi-fix diffs.
    Package 2: Distributed Actor Framework & Zero-Copy Concurrency Channels
      std/src/ooda/actor/ (actor_types, actor_mailbox, actor_supervision, actor_router, actor)
      std/src/ooda/concurrency/ (channel_types, ring_buffer, channel_select, channel)
      Type-safe actors, supervisor trees (OneForOne/OneForAll), lock-free SPSC/MPMC ring buffers.
    Package 3: Hardware Attestation, Secure Time & OS Cgroups Quotas
      std/src/ooda/sec/attest/ (attest_types, tpm_quote, entropy_health, monotonic_time, attest)
      std/src/ooda/os/cgroup/ (cgroup_types, cgroup_v2, rlimit_quota, cgroup)
      TPM quotes, PCR banks, NIST SP 800-90B RCT/APT entropy tests, cgroup v2, POSIX rlimits.
    Package 4: Merkle DAG Memory Store & Metamorphic Decoy Security
      std/src/ooda/merkle/ (merkle_types, merkle_tree, merkle_proof, merkle_dag, merkle)
      std/src/ooda/sec/metamorphic/ (meta_types, meta_pad, meta_layout, meta)
      Content-addressable DAG state snapshots, inclusion proofs, METAMORPHIC: path-a layout perturbation.

  Foundation Tracks 1-4
    Track 1: AST Macros & Metaprogramming (std/src/ooda/macro/, oodac/ast_macros.oo)
    Track 2: WebAssembly Backend Emitter (oodac/wasm_emit_*.oo)
    Track 3: Finer Object-Capability Seals & Landlock Sandboxing (std/src/ooda/sec/sys/)
    Track 4: Data-Oriented Design & Struct-of-Arrays (std/src/ooda/dod/)

  Std product
    ../ooda/std and ../std modules (over 1,000 files across crypto, sys, sec, dod, macro, 3d, robot, quantum, fin, enterprise)
    100% DINNER.oot Academy-style headers and <= 256-line modular decomposition.

  Scripts
